22:["$","section",null,{"className":"pb-10 pt-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide max-w-4xl","children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl leading-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl","children":"Business Registration FAQs"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"The questions we are asked most about registering and running a business in India, grouped by structure."}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"FAQ sections","className":"mt-8","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","li","general",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#general","className":"inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-secondary hover:border-primary hover:text-primary","children":"General"}]}],["$","li","pvt-registration",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#pvt-registration","className":"inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-secondary hover:border-primary hover:text-primary","children":"Private Limited Company Registration"}]}],["$","li","llp-registration",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#llp-registration","className":"inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-secondary hover:border-primary hover:text-primary","children":"LLP Registration"}]}],["$","li","partnership-registration",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#partnership-registration","className":"inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-secondary hover:border-primary hover:text-primary","children":"Partnership Firm Registration"}]}],["$","li","proprietorship-registration",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#proprietorship-registration","className":"inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-secondary hover:border-primary hover:text-primary","children":"Proprietorship Registration"}]}]]}]}]]}]}]
23:["$","section","general",{"id":"general","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl","children":"General"}],null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","Which business structure should I choose?",{"className":"group","id":"general-faq-1","name":"general-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Which business structure should I choose?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"It depends on three things: whether you will have co-owners, whether you intend to raise outside investment, and how much liability the business carries. A single owner starting small usually begins as a proprietorship. Two or more people who want liability capped generally choose an LLP. Founders planning to raise equity or issue ESOPs need a Private Limited Company, because it is the only one of the four that can issue shares."}]}]]}],["$","details","How long does business registration take in India?",{"className":"group","id":"general-faq-2","name":"general-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How long does business registration take in India?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"With complete documents, a Private Limited Company commonly takes around 7 to 12 working days and an LLP around 7 to 10. A partnership deed can be executed within a few days, with Registrar of Firms timelines varying by state. Proprietorship registrations such as Udyam are often same-day, while GST commonly takes 7 to 15 working days. These are estimates: government processing times vary."}]}]]}],["$","details","What does registration cost?",{"className":"group","id":"general-faq-3","name":"general-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What does registration cost?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Our professional fee is ₹9,999 for a Private Limited Company and ₹7,999 for an LLP. Government filing fees and stamp duty are payable in addition and depend on the state and the capital involved. For Partnership Firm and Proprietorship registration, the cost depends on which registrations your specific activity needs, so we quote after understanding the business."}]}]]}],"$L2f","$L30","$L31"]}]]}]}]
24:["$","section","pvt-registration",{"id":"pvt-registration","className":"section-padding bg-muted","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl","children":"Private Limited Company Registration"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/services/pvt-registration/","className":"link-target text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline","children":["Read the full ","Private Limited Company Registration"," page →"]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","What is a Private Limited Company?",{"className":"group","id":"pvt-registration-faq-1","name":"pvt-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is a Private Limited Company?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"A Private Limited Company is a company incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013, that restricts the transfer of its shares and limits its membership to 200 shareholders. It is a separate legal entity, so the company rather than its owners holds its assets and owes its debts, and shareholders are liable only to the extent of any unpaid amount on their shares."}]}]]}],["$","details","Who can register a Private Limited Company?",{"className":"group","id":"pvt-registration-faq-2","name":"pvt-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Who can register a Private Limited Company?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Any two or more people who are competent to contract can incorporate one, and companies and LLPs can also be shareholders. At least two directors are required, and at least one of them must be a resident of India, meaning a stay of 182 days or more in the previous calendar year. A director must be an individual holding a valid DIN."}]}]]}],["$","details","How many directors and shareholders are required?",{"className":"group","id":"pvt-registration-faq-3","name":"pvt-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How many directors and shareholders are required?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"A minimum of two directors and two shareholders. The same two people can hold both roles, so two founders are enough to incorporate. The maximum is 15 directors, which can be increased by a special resolution, and 200 shareholders."}]}]]}],"$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38"]}]]}]}]
25:["$","section","llp-registration",{"id":"llp-registration","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl","children":"LLP Registration"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/services/llp-registration/","className":"link-target text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline","children":["Read the full ","LLP Registration"," page →"]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","What is an LLP?",{"className":"group","id":"llp-registration-faq-1","name":"llp-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is an LLP?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"A Limited Liability Partnership is a body corporate registered under the LLP Act, 2008. It has a legal identity separate from its partners, so it can own property and contract in its own name, while partners are liable only to the extent of the contribution they have agreed to bring in."}]}]]}],["$","details","Who should choose an LLP?",{"className":"group","id":"llp-registration-faq-2","name":"llp-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Who should choose an LLP?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"An LLP suits a business run by the people who own it, where profit sharing is negotiated between partners and there is no plan to raise equity investment. Professional practices, consultancies and partner-operated service firms are common examples. If you expect to take on investors, a Private Limited Company is the more workable structure."}]}]]}],["$","details","How many partners are required?",{"className":"group","id":"llp-registration-faq-3","name":"llp-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How many partners are required?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"At least two partners, with no upper limit. At least two of them must be designated partners, who must be individuals and carry the responsibility for statutory compliance, and at least one designated partner must be a resident of India."}]}]]}],["$","details","What are designated partners?",{"className":"group","id":"llp-registration-faq-4","name":"llp-registration-faq","children":["$L39","$L3a"]}],"$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40"]}]]}]}]
26:["$","section","partnership-registration",{"id":"partnership-registration","className":"section-padding bg-muted","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl","children":"Partnership Firm Registration"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/services/partnership-registration/","className":"link-target text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline","children":["Read the full ","Partnership Firm Registration"," page →"]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","What is a partnership firm?",{"className":"group","id":"partnership-registration-faq-1","name":"partnership-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is a partnership firm?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"A partnership firm is a business carried on by two or more people who have agreed to share its profits, under the Indian Partnership Act, 1932. The firm is not a separate legal entity, so in law the partners collectively are the business, and they are personally responsible for its obligations."}]}]]}],["$","details","How many partners are required?",{"className":"group","id":"partnership-registration-faq-2","name":"partnership-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How many partners are required?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"At least two. The maximum is 50 partners, as prescribed under the rules made under the Companies Act. Every partner must be competent to contract, so a minor cannot be a partner, although a minor can be admitted to the benefits of a partnership with the consent of all partners."}]}]]}],["$","details","What is a partnership deed?",{"className":"group","id":"partnership-registration-faq-3","name":"partnership-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is a partnership deed?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"The partnership deed is the written agreement between the partners. It records capital contributions, profit and loss sharing ratios, remuneration and interest on capital, each partner's duties and authority, banking arrangements, and how a partner is admitted, retires or is removed. Where the deed is silent, the default provisions of the Partnership Act apply, which may not be what the partners intended."}]}]]}],"$L41","$L42","$L43","$L44","$L45","$L46"]}]]}]}]
27:["$","section","proprietorship-registration",{"id":"proprietorship-registration","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl","children":"Proprietorship Registration"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/services/proprietorship-registration/","className":"link-target text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline","children":["Read the full ","Proprietorship Registration"," page →"]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","What is a proprietorship?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-1","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is a proprietorship?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"A proprietorship is a business owned by one individual. It is not incorporated and has no legal identity separate from its owner, so the proprietor personally owns the assets, owes the debts and is assessed to tax on the income."}]}]]}],["$","details","Is a proprietorship a separate legal entity?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-2","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is a proprietorship a separate legal entity?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"No. This is the most important thing to understand about the structure. Unlike a Private Limited Company or an LLP, a proprietorship is legally the same person as its owner. The business cannot contract in its own name, cannot hold property in its own name, and does not receive its own PAN. There is also no limit on the proprietor's liability for business debts."}]}]]}],["$","details","Is there a government proprietorship registration certificate?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-3","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is there a government proprietorship registration certificate?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"No. There is no single registration or certificate that establishes a proprietorship, because it is not incorporated. A proprietorship is evidenced by the registrations it actually holds, most commonly Udyam registration, GST registration where applicable, and a shop and establishment registration. Be cautious of any provider that claims to issue a government proprietorship certificate."}]}]]}],"$L47","$L48","$L49","$L4a","$L4b","$L4c","$L4d"]}]]}]}]
28:["$","$L4e",null,{"title":"Question not answered here?","body":"Call us or send a message. We will tell you what applies to your business specifically, before you commit to anything."}]
